Package: backup-manager
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         nodejs (>= 22),
Recommends: mariadb-client | default-mysql-client,
            systemd,
Description: back up MariaDB databases and Laravel storage per environment
 bkm backs up MariaDB databases (mariadb-dump, gzip) and the storage
 directories of Laravel projects (tar.gz), grouped by environment, with a
 retention policy and a manifest with checksums for every backup.
 .
 Everything is managed from one full-screen terminal UI. A user-level
 systemd service runs the cron schedules, catches up on runs missed while
 the machine was off and serves a read-only HTTP API. No root, sudo or cron
 is needed.
 .
 The package carries the Node.js libraries the program uses. It needs
 Node.js 22 or later; see README.Debian when the distribution's is older.
